{"ticker":"PSX","updated":"2026-10-23T23:48:14Z","profile":{"longName":"Phillips 66","shortName":"Phillips 66","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing","country":"United States","website":"https://www.phillips66.com","fullTimeEmployees":12600,"marketCap":113536770048,"trailingPE":16.181713,"forwardPE":9.330216,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.7461326,"pegRatio":0.91,"targetMeanPrice":285.73685,"targetHighPrice":350.0,"targetLowPrice":173.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.531,"earningsGrowth":3.449,"grossMargins":0.13098,"operatingMargins":0.08529,"profitMargins":0.046609998,"totalRevenue":152167006208,"beta":0.701,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":299.39,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":127.16,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.87},"summary":"Phillips 66 operates as an integrated downstream energy provider in the United States, the United Kingdom, Germany, and internationally. It operates through five segments: Midstream, Chemicals, Refining, Marketing and Specialties (M&S), and Renewable Fuels. The Midstream segment provides crude oil and refined petroleum product transportation, terminaling, and storage services, as well as natural gas and natural gas liquids (NGL) gathering, processing, transportation, fractionation, storage and marketing services. It also exports liquefied petroleum gas. The Chemicals segment produces and markets ethylene and other olefin products; aromatics and styrenics products, such as benzene, cyclohexane, styrene, and polystyrene; various specialty chemical products, including organosulfur chemicals, solvents, catalysts, and chemicals used in drilling and mining; and petrochemicals and plastics. The Refining segment refines crude oil and other feedstocks into petroleum products, such as gasolines and distillates, including aviation fuels. The M&S segment purchases for resale and markets refined products, including gasolines, distillates, and aviation fuels. This segment also manufactures and markets specialty products, such as automotive, commercial, industrial, and specialty lubricants, as well as base oils. The Renewable Fuels segment processes renewable feedstocks into renewable product","summary_zh":"Phillips 66 在美國、英國、德國和國際上作為一家綜合下游能源提供者運作。它透過五個部門運作：中游部門、化學品部門、煉油部門、行銷和特殊產品部門 (M&S) 以及再生燃料部門。中游部門提供原油和成品油運輸、碼頭和儲存服務，以及天然氣和天然氣液體（NGL）收集、加工、運輸、分餾、儲存和行銷服務。它還出口液化石油氣。化學品部門生產和銷售乙烯和其他烯烴產品；芳烴和苯乙烯產品，例如苯、環己烷、苯乙烯和聚苯乙烯；各種特種化學產品，包括有機硫化學品、溶劑、催化劑以及鑽探和採礦用化學品；以及石化和塑膠。煉油部門將原油和其他原料精煉成石油產品，例如汽油和餾分油，包括航空燃料。馬莎百貨部門購買轉售和行銷精煉產品，包括汽油、餾分油和航空燃料。該部門還生產和銷售特種產品，例如汽車、商業、工業和特殊潤滑油以及基礎油。再生燃料部門將再生原料加工成再生產品","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油與天然氣精煉與行銷","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":129.45,"h":130.93,"l":128.98,"c":129.52,"v":2051200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":128.64,"h":130.09,"l":128.14,"c":129.89,"v":2777500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":129.75,"h":133.33,"l":129.22,"c":132.62,"v":2031700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":132.82,"h":133.35,"l":131.5,"c":132.83,"v":1982300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":132.82,"h":134.34,"l":132.06,"c":133.58,"v":1530700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":132.73,"h":133.95,"l":132.01,"c":133.84,"v":2114000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":131.5,"h":133.84,"l":129.67,"c":130.53,"v":2290900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":130.64,"h":132.18,"l":129.93,"c":131.58,"v":1832200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":130.79,"h":132.25,"l":129.85,"c":131.55,"v":1828500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":132.04,"h":132.45,"l":129.85,"c":130.21,"v":2802400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":131.35,"h":135.22,"l":130.14,"c":132.29,"v":2830700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":131.97,"h":133.69,"l":128.36,"c":131.42,"v":2424700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":131.44,"h":133.36,"l":131.11,"c":132.52,"v":2155900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":132.69,"h":133.3,"l":130.69,"c":130.78,"v":1380600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":130.79,"h":132.13,"l":130.16,"c":131.18,"v":1730000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":132.15,"h":133.59,"l":131.5,"c":133.04,"v":1767500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":132.32,"h":134.76,"l":132.0,"c":133.14,"v":3287600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":134.1,"h":134.1,"l":130.94,"c":131.35,